id: empowered-weather
name: Empowered Weather
advancement: true
prerequisite: Tier of Power 3+
tpCost: 10
weatherUnnatural: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Weather Summoning at the Unnatural Tier for 2(bT) more.
text: >
  Empowered Weather: The impact of your summoned storms is greater than normal.
  –Prerequisites: Tier of Power 3+
  –TP Cost: 10
  –Effect: You may increase the Ki Point Cost of this Unique Ability by 2(bT) upon using it so your Battle Weather’s
  Weather Tier is Unnatural.
